  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to Use This Log Viewer",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Quick Filters\n- Use **job** to switch between `system`, `user`, and `observability` logs.\n- Use **log_type** to narrow to wifi, install, diagnostics, app, or system logs.\n- Use **filename** to open one specific file.\n- Use **search** for keywords like `error`, `failed`, or an app name.\n\nTips:\n- Set time range to **Last 1 hour** for real\u2011time debugging.\n- Expand a log row to see full metadata and file path."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read Me",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Mac Logs (System + Apps)\nUse filters at the top to choose **job** (system/user/observability) and **log_type** (system, wifi, app, diagnostics).\n\nWhat this helps you answer:\n- **Is there a system problem?** Look for errors in system and wifi logs.\n- **Did an app crash?** Check diagnostic reports.\n- **Is observability healthy?** Check Grafana/Prometheus/node_exporter logs.\n\nTip: Start with **job=system** and **log_type=system** for OS issues."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "All Logs (Filtered)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efccujve04lxca"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{job=~\"$job\",log_type=~\"$log_type\",filename=~\"$filename\"} |= \"$search\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "signature",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineLimit": 500,
            "showTime": true,
            "showLabels": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "System Critical (errors/warn)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
